  "readmeFile": "PACKAGE.md",
  "releaseNotes": "XInclude 1.0. Adds XIncludeProcessor, expanding xi:include (parse=\"xml\" and parse=\"text\") with xi:fallback recovery and the full W3C XPointer framework (shorthand, element(), xmlns(), xpath1()), including same-document references, before conversion to XDM. References resolve through a host-injectable IXmlResourceResolver; the default resolver is local-file-only unless AllowRemote is set, with DTD processing prohibited on every fetch (no XXE) and intervening xml:base honoured. Expansion is bounded against untrusted input via configurable limits (descent depth, produced-node count, per-resource size, and per-xpath1 evaluation time). Additive only; no public API removed. See RELEASES.md for full notes.",
